<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<!-- Approved cache policy: 24-hour storage, 5-second pending display. -->
	<key>SOOMFeedStaleCacheEnabled</key>
	<true/>
	<key>SOOMFeedCacheStorageSeconds</key>
	<real>86400</real>
	<key>SOOMFeedCacheDisplaySeconds</key>
	<real>5</real>
	<key>CFBundleDevelopmentRegion</key>
	<string>$(DEVELOPMENT_LANGUAGE)</string>
	<key>CFBundleDisplayName</key>
	<string>SOOM</string>
	<key>CFBundleExecutable</key>
	<string>$(EXECUTABLE_NAME)</string>
	<key>CFBundleIdentifier</key>
	<string>$(PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER)</string>
	<key>CFBundleIconName</key>
	<string>AppIcon</string>
	<key>CFBundleInfoDictionaryVersion</key>
	<string>6.0</string>
	<key>CFBundleName</key>
	<string>$(PRODUCT_NAME)</string>
	<key>CFBundlePackageType</key>
	<string>$(PRODUCT_BUNDLE_PACKAGE_TYPE)</string>
	<key>CFBundleURLTypes</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>CFBundleURLName</key>
			<string>app.soom.auth</string>
			<key>CFBundleURLSchemes</key>
			<array>
				<string>$(SOOM_AUTH_REDIRECT_SCHEME)</string>
			</array>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>CFBundleURLName</key>
			<string>app.soom.workout</string>
			<key>CFBundleURLSchemes</key>
			<array>
				<string>soom-workout</string>
			</array>
		</dict>
	</array>
	<key>CFBundleShortVersionString</key>
	<string>$(MARKETING_VERSION)</string>
	<key>CFBundleVersion</key>
	<string>$(CURRENT_PROJECT_VERSION)</string>
	<key>ITSAppUsesNonExemptEncryption</key>
	<false/>
	<key>LSApplicationCategoryType</key>
	<string>public.app-category.healthcare-fitness</string>
	<key>NSHealthShareUsageDescription</key>
	<string>SOOM은 운동 기록, 심박, 거리, 활동 에너지 데이터를 읽어 회복 흐름과 운동 분석을 더 이해하기 쉽게 보여주기 위해 사용합니다.</string>
	<key>NSHealthUpdateUsageDescription</key>
	<string>SOOM은 운동 분석을 위해 Apple 건강 앱의 운동 정보를 읽습니다. 현재 버전은 건강 앱에 운동을 저장하거나 수정하지 않으며 쓰기 권한을 요청하지 않습니다.</string>
	<key>NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
	<string>SOOM은 현재 위치를 지도와 날씨에 사용합니다. 시작한 운동의 경로는 화면이 잠겨도 기록하며, 일시정지하거나 종료하면 운동 위치 수집을 멈춥니다.</string>
	<key>NSPhotoLibraryAddUsageDescription</key>
	<string>SOOM은 사용자가 선택한 공유 이미지를 사진 앱에 저장하기 위해 권한을 요청합니다.</string>
	<key>UIApplicationSceneManifest</key>
	<dict>
		<key>UIApplicationSupportsMultipleScenes</key>
		<false/>
	</dict>
	<key>UIApplicationSupportsIndirectInputEvents</key>
	<true/>
	<key>UIBackgroundModes</key>
	<array>
		<string>location</string>
		<string>audio</string>
		<string>remote-notification</string>
	</array>
	<key>UIUserInterfaceStyle</key>
	<string>Light</string>
	<key>UILaunchScreen</key>
	<dict/>
	<key>UIAppFonts</key>
	<array>
		<string>GmarketSansTTFMedium.ttf</string>
		<string>GmarketSansTTFBold.ttf</string>
		<string>NanumSquareNeo-bRg.ttf</string>
		<string>NanumSquareNeo-cBd.ttf</string>
	</array>
	<key>UISupportedInterfaceOrientations</key>
	<array>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationPortrait</string>
	</array>
	<key>MBXAccessToken</key>
	<string>$(MBX_ACCESS_TOKEN)</string>
	<key>OPENWEATHER_API_KEY</key>
	<string>$(OPENWEATHER_API_KEY)</string>
	<key>WEATHER_API_KEY</key>
	<string>$(WEATHER_API_KEY)</string>
	<key>SOOMPrivacyPolicyURL</key>
	<string>$(SOOM_PRIVACY_POLICY_URL)</string>
	<key>SOOMSupabaseURL</key>
	<string>$(SOOM_SUPABASE_URL)</string>
	<key>SOOMSupabaseAnonKey</key>
	<string>$(SOOM_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY)</string>
	<key>SOOMAuthRedirectScheme</key>
	<string>$(SOOM_AUTH_REDIRECT_SCHEME)</string>
	<key>NSSupportsLiveActivities</key>
	<true/>
</dict>
</plist>
